WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.530
- We have almost run out of time,

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.330
but I have one more
story I hope you enjoy.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.500
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.346
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:07.590
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.300
If you have stairs in your home,

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.330
it tends to be the place
where junk collects.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.430
But as one mama in Tennessee proved,

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:18.426
men have this incredible ability
to just walk past it all.

00:00:18.426 --> 00:00:19.259
(transition whooshing)

00:00:19.259 --> 00:00:22.259
(mischievous music)

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:29.871
(Kelly laughing)
(audience clapping)

00:00:29.871 --> 00:00:30.840
(audience cheering)

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:31.673
Don't worry.

00:00:31.673 --> 00:00:33.930
Her husband was totally
dragged online for that

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.070
'cause it's amazing.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.280
We have Laura on the line,
watching on WVLT Knoxville.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.274
What's up, Laura? (laughs)

00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:40.722
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:40.722 --> 00:00:43.323
- Hello, Kelly. Thank you
so much for having me.

00:00:43.323 --> 00:00:46.230
It's so nice to meet you! I'm
fangirling over here. (laughs)

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.850
- Oh, I love it! I'm fangirling.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.320
You are hilarious.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.120
I think a lot of women-
- Oh my god.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.890
- Totally love your video and relate.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.110
Were you surprised by the response?

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:55.980
- I was.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.430
I cannot believe millions
and millions of other moms

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:02.850
out there, other wives out
there resonated with that video.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.370
It's clear that a lot
of other men out there

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.680
like to pass things by at
the bottom of the stairs.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.240
It happens constantly.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.447
- My favorite part is when they go,

00:01:10.447 --> 00:01:11.550
"Oh, I didn't notice it."

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.547
And I'm like, "You"-
(audience laughing)

00:01:12.547 --> 00:01:14.190
"You didn't notice the four hurdles

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.030
on the way to the room?

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.337
Cool. Think we should work on that."

00:01:16.337 --> 00:01:18.418
- Right? I'm like-
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:18.418 --> 00:01:19.251
(Laura laughing)

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:20.084
- Do you think-
- Yes.

00:01:20.084 --> 00:01:21.367
Almost every time, I'm like,

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:23.580
"Did you not see that huge pile of stuff

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.500
and the suitcase that you had to move"-

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.510
(Kelly laughing)
"To get up the stairs?"

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.910
And he said, "What stuff?" every time.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:30.870
I don't understand.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.580
- It's like magic.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.500
So wait, do you think
he learned his lesson

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.090
after you posted this?

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.910
- Well, judging by the huge pile of stuff

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.823
at the bottom of our stairs right now-

00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:42.879
(Kelly laughing)
I would say no.

00:01:42.879 --> 00:01:44.460
(Kelly clapping)
But we're still working on it.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.610
You know, it's a new year,
New Year's resolutions.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:49.230
That's gonna be his New Year's resolution

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.600
that I am giving to him, okay? (laughs)

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.448
- That is such a great gift to give.

00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:55.080
(laughing) I love it.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.190
It's very-
- Right? Right?

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:57.930
- Very, very relatable, Laura.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.430
We love it. It's hilarious.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.751
And I'm liking your post
right now, all right?

00:02:01.751 --> 00:02:03.390
(audience clapping)

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.340
- Oh, well, thank you so much.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:06.450
I really appreciate it.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:09.900
It was so nice to meet you, and
I'm just so glad to be here.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.310
- Oh, thank you so much, Laura.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.720
Have such a blessed year.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.550
And everybody, that's not all.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.100
Our season-long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.780
the go-to pen of "The
Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.060
want to honor strong mamas like yourself

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.130
who hold it down and pick all that crap up

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:24.180
'cause somebody else won't.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:27.131
So they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:02:27.131 --> 00:02:28.399
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:28.399 --> 00:02:30.985
- Oh my god!
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:32.390
Thank you, Kelly!

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:34.260
- Absolutely. Thank you, Laura.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:36.150
And thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:39.720
Jenna Dewan, Sam Jay, Jillian
Michaels, Aoife O'Donovan,

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.040
and everyone over at "The Rookie,"

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.300
I love y'all so much.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.450
Have a great day, and if
it's not, try and change it.

